        "payload": "tree b02252990faf43061269230fc45d5b3c1f95bbfe\nparent 363d9e9d38154b7dced1767e996f8f18f391fcff\nauthor Jorge Espada <jorge@esprim.io> 1793361406 -0300\ncommitter Jorge Espada <jorge@esprim.io> 1793361406 -0300\n\nguix: compute --build triplet when lowering, not at load time\n\nbuilding-on read %current-system when toolchains.scm was loaded. guix\nshell loads the manifest before it applies --system, so a\n--system=aarch64-linux build on an x86_64 machine configured the aarch64\ntoolchain with --build=x86_64-guix-linux-gnu, and gcc-cross failed to\nconfigure. Make building-on a procedure so each derivation uses its own\nsystem. Native builds produce the same derivations as before.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg6hL1JhNljIOFclMXOq3CHYuaEP\naX2MB2se4CW6WgXTsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKcE2uwymy5R5fj5aM58Ih+mW2g2cLL7XEdIgcc4wTd17vPK5xarsYjsMy+geyMLJB\nRByFwIO8qdWNY/lnEHKAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----"
